{"unit_id":"blazar-source__dsh-r7-office#feature-1","repo":"blazar-source/dsh-r7-office","commit":"83e4e9871e73280d0a2e30aa19a9e81791d017b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"R7-Office 的文档读取功能：检查 DOCX、XLSX、PPTX 的结构，并读取段落、表格、工作表范围或幻灯片内容。通过 r7_inspect 或 r7_read 触发，输入文件路径及可选范围，输出结构化内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/mcp/tools.js:33-88"]}
{"unit_id":"blazar-source__dsh-r7-office#feature-2","repo":"blazar-source/dsh-r7-office","commit":"83e4e9871e73280d0a2e30aa19a9e81791d017b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"R7-Office 的 DOCX 段落编辑功能：按段落索引更新文字、调整样式或删除段落。调用 r7_edit 并提供文档路径和索引，可选指定输出路径，返回处理后的文件结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/mcp/tools-docx.js:93-114"]}
{"unit_id":"blazar-source__dsh-r7-office#feature-3","repo":"blazar-source/dsh-r7-office","commit":"83e4e9871e73280d0a2e30aa19a9e81791d017b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"R7-Office 的 XLSX 单元格功能：读取或写入指定工作表和范围中的值、日期或公式，也可设置字体、填充、边框和数字格式。通过 r7_sheet_read、r7_sheet_write 或 r7_sheet_format 调用。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/mcp/tools-xlsx.js:15-68"]}
{"unit_id":"blazar-source__dsh-r7-office#feature-4","repo":"blazar-source/dsh-r7-office","commit":"83e4e9871e73280d0a2e30aa19a9e81791d017b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"R7-Office 的 PPTX 幻灯片功能：读取幻灯片对象及继承的版式信息，创建新页或追加页面，并调整对象文字、几何位置和样式。通过 r7_slide_read、r7_slide_create 和 r7_slide_format 触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/mcp/tools-pptx.js:98-176"]}
{"unit_id":"blazar-source__dsh-r7-office#feature-5","repo":"blazar-source/dsh-r7-office","commit":"83e4e9871e73280d0a2e30aa19a9e81791d017b7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"R7-Office 的格式转换功能：通过 r7_convert 将办公文档转换为 PDF、HTML、TXT 或其他 Office 格式；输入源文件和目标路径，XLSX 转 PDF 时还可选择工作表。转换调用本机 R7 引擎。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/mcp/tools.js:136-160","src/r7/adapter.js:27-45"]}
